notes:        Effects workspace showing the EffectCraft VFX browser, Program monitor, Transform/Crop/Speed/Effects inspector toggles, VFX Nodes DAG (Unsharp Mask GPU node), Effect Controls keyframe lanes, and live RGB Parade video scopes. All UI icons are drawn in code; fonts are Inter and JetBrains Mono (OFL-1.1). Contains no Adobe artwork.
